    "notes": [
      "The bible's 'replace one discovered tomb rule with an approved alternate rule until the party leaves the site'. The engine's half of that is the removal: the rule stops applying, here and for the rest of the expedition (ExpeditionState.suppressed_site_rules). The alternate rule the custodial school would cut in its place is authored fiction and no mechanic; nothing here claims it is one.",
      "Which rule: the first still in force, in the cell's authored order. blocked: needs decision -- there is no screen for the player to choose one from, and a deterministic order is the honest stand-in rather than a choice nobody can make.",
      "Once per expedition, and suppressed_site_rules being non-empty is the record of it. One fact, one owner."
    ]
